### Create a basketball match (organizer: ana)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches?organizerId=3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateFrom": "2026-10-17T20:00:00",
  "dateTo": "2026-10-17T21:30:00",
  "sportId": 2,
  "venueId": 2
}

### All matches
GET http://localhost:8090/api/matches

### Volleyball
POST http://localhost:8090/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Volleyball", "numberOfPlayers": 12 }

### Table tennis
POST http://localhost:8090/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Table Tennis", "numberOfPlayers": 2 }

### Handball
POST http://localhost:8090/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Handball", "numberOfPlayers": 14 }

### Create a basketball match (organizer: marko)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches?organizerId=2
Content-Type: application/json

{
"dateFrom": "2026-10-28T20:00:00",
"dateTo": "2026-10-28T21:30:00",
"sportId": 2,
"venueId": 2
}

### Login (ana)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ana", "password": "password" }

### Register new player
POST http://localhost:8090/api/auth/register/player
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "petar", "email": "petar@test.com", "password": "secret123" }

### Wrong password → 401
POST http://localhost:8090/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ana", "password": "wrong" }

### Login → земи токен
POST http://localhost:8090/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ana", "password": "password" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Кој сум јас (со токен)
GET http://localhost:8090/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Без токен → 401
GET http://localhost:8090/api/auth/me

### Ana пробува да додаде спорт → 403
POST http://localhost:8090/api/sports
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "name": "Rugby", "numberOfPlayers": 30 }

### Join без playerId (ana од токенот)
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches/1/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches/1/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ana откажува туѓ натпревар → 403
POST http://localhost:8090/api/matches/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}